versions of the book to take (almost) another year before they come out?</div> </div> </div> </div>We always need to provide a conservative estimate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:39:22-07:00","id":1200121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200106#post1200106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, I've pledged and all, but man, OPP kickstarters often frustrate me.<br /> <br /> All I want is a pledge tier that gets me:<br /> <br /> 1) The standard, plain old physical copy of whatever they're kickstarting.<br /> 2) A PDF of same.<br /> <br /> That's never, ever ever ever available, or at least not on anything I'm ever interested in. Tiers always go right from &quot;PDF only plus a lot of ancillary stuff I don't usually care about&quot; straight up to &quot;premium hardcover.&quot;<br /> <br /> This usually leads to me not backing, because I don't like most games as much as I like Exalted. I just wait patiently until the book drops and then buy the standard version from DTRPG for much cheaper than the premium one is.<br /> <br /> I mean. I'm just a drop in the bucket for most OPP games, but man is it frustrating.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Was there ever a regular version of Exalted 3rd Edition? Or just the PDF and deluxe hardcover? I think this may be following a similar path.<br /> <br /> I know on the last 3 kickstarters that I ran for them, we didn't have deluxe versions, just regular hardcover levels. Trinity was a bit more complicated, because there were 2 books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22659-kickstarter-james","name":"Kickstarter James","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22659_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:39:35-07:00","id":1200122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200119#post1200119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They\u2019re estimating up. The text is done and art is coming in, but they\u2019re trying to account for possible unexpected delays.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's exactly why I was confused, with the current state the book is in, I expected it to drop sometime in summer or so, not next year. But I guess I'll have to wait and see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2219-delta","name":"Delta","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:39:57-07:00","id":1200123,"title":"","content":"Those magnificent bastards included a census! The rest of the books could literally be awful and I would not regret my investment.<br /> <br /> 3000 Lookshyians huh, I am assuming that I know their profession....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:41:43-07:00","id":1200125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Delta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200110#post1200110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to ask: So the estimated date means that they fully expect the PDF/PoD versions of the book to take (almost) another year before they come out?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Much learning in the past 5 years. Assume that delivery date has lots of disasters built in. And who knows what will happen, but the feeling is better safe than sorry.<br /> <br /> I can say the manuscript is done, and I've posted some layout images on the kickstarter that aren't just mock-ups. There's still some adjusting to do, but some real, actual layout work has been done. I think everyone's paying special attention to this project and working hard to keep everything on the rails.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22659-kickstarter-james","name":"Kickstarter James","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22659_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:52:02-07:00","id":1200130,"title":"","content":"I'm in. Long lead time to get it published, even with all the text done. Dec. 2019 estimated delivery. That means probably, what, 2020 for Lunars at best? Ouch.<br /> <br /> Well, it'll be cool when it gets here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I do really like the reward tier grid. That's very helpful in deciding exactly what I need to get. For instance, I don't need the core PDF again, or the 1st &amp; 2nd rescans, so that made it really easy to pick what I needed.<br /> <br /> Thanks guys!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:52:08-07:00","id":1200131,"title":"","content":"Okay, this is my favorite part so far:<br /> <br /> <i>Pushed to the ground one too many times by the city guard, a street urchin finds unexpected strength within his blood. He stands up as tall as he can manage and feels as though a great pillar has grown within him; the hard ground below is no longer uninviting. When the guard strikes again, the boy cannot be moved.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:58:26-07:00","id":1200133,"title":"","content":"Hehe it seems Mnemon Caras Farim may be getting wise to Chejop.<br /> <br /> <br /> So I wonder how many Forest Witches are there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:15:02-07:00","id":1200145,"title":"","content":"Darn you Tiresias! I was #2, haha. If only you had sneezed or something!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1092-tribute-of-a-dark-heart","name":"Tribute of a Dark Heart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1092_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:20:26-07:00","id":1200149,"title":"","content":"Let the stretch goals begin! *plays mortal-kombat-techno-crazy-music*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:22:18-07:00","id":1200150,"title":"","content":"Will 9 people please invest in the remaining charm slots before I'm tempted to do something stupid like set up an additional kickstarter account to get a second charm.... my roommate is at work and she's 86% of my impulse control!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:23:22-07:00","id":1200151,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm going to start reading the manuscript preview now, but I wanted to give props for the design of the KS itself first. The project page really readable and comprehensive, and as has been said, the backer reward tier spread sheet is super helpful.<br /> <br /> In particular, I'd like to compliment the special backer reward tier General of the Vermillion Legion, for this phrasing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> SPECIAL: You will name an NPC added to official canon and featured in the Dragon-Blooded Companion PDF (or a subsequent Exalted 3rd Edition supplement if necessary). </div> </div> </div>That's much better than the &quot;add your character's name&quot; reward from the 3e core KS. It's great to see that Onyx Path takes this kind of critique to heart.<br /> <br /> This time I got on the Sorcerer of the Scarlet Throne backer reward level. I'm sure that'll be great!</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 03-27-2018, 02:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:24:19-07:00","id":1200152,"title":"","content":"I got backer number 12. Not bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:36:13-07:00","id":1200155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>At $120,000 in funding - HEIRS TO THE SHOGUNATE - LOOKSHY EXPANSION</b><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> - Additional setting detail and mechanics for Lookshy, including stats and Evocations for their fabled <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>gunzosha armor</b> </span>will be added to the Dragon-Blooded Companion PDF.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Not Fair hiding the Gunzosha armor in a stretch goal. Now we got to reach it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1151-walkingeye","name":"WalkingEye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1151_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:39:35-07:00","id":1200156,"title":"","content":"Give it a couple more hours.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:42:50-07:00","id":1200157,"title":"","content":"I got backer number 4. Was way too hyped to stay away.<br /> <br /> (the $320 I've pledged so far is mostly funded by a positive tax return ^^)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 03-27-2018, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:43:29-07:00","id":1200158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WalkingEye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200155#post1200155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not Fair hiding the Gunzosha armor in a stretch goal. Now we got to reach it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is a bit excessive. 20k per goal got dark eras in trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:48:11-07:00","id":1200159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200106#post1200106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, I've pledged and all, but man, OPP kickstarters often frustrate me.<br /> <br /> All I want is a pledge tier that gets me:<br /> <br /> 1) The standard, plain old physical copy of whatever they're kickstarting.<br /> 2) A PDF of same.<br /> <br /> That's never, ever ever ever available, or at least not on anything I'm ever interested in. Tiers always go right from &quot;PDF only plus a lot of ancillary stuff I don't usually care about&quot; straight up to &quot;premium hardcover.&quot;<br /> <br /> This usually leads to me not backing, because I don't like most games as much as I like Exalted. I just wait patiently until the book drops and then buy the standard version from DTRPG for much cheaper than the premium one is.<br /> <br /> I mean. I'm just a drop in the bucket for most OPP games, but man is it frustrating.</div> </div> </div> </div>OPP has flat out stated the standard edition is not what their KS are for. So you can continue to be frustrated by it, but they've already given you the answer already. You continuing to be mad at the process is on you.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Q: </span></span></span><i>Why is a Kickstarter necessary?</i></i> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>A. It isn\u2019t. All our White Wolf licensed Kickstarters thus far, and all similar planned future Kickstarters, <b>are for deluxe editions only</b>...&quot;</i></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:53:39-07:00","id":1200163,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gigaton-Falcon-Emu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200158#post1200158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is a bit excessive. 20k per goal got dark eras in trouble.</div> </div> </div> </div>Distance between stretch goals will diminish as we move from the first few days' headlong rush into the slow mid-month creep of the Kickstarter life cycle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T11:53:39-07:00","id":1200164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gigaton-Falcon-Emu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200158#post1200158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is a bit excessive. 20k per goal got dark eras in trouble.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Going up as soon as it did after the original book's companion came out, and not including any written text yet is what got Dark Eras II in trouble. Dragon-Blooded is doing fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cust