ne a classroom of 14 year old brats who are all like that. I hope the teachers are paid well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 03-27-2018, 03:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T12:05:52-07:00","id":1200171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gigaton-Falcon-Emu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200167#post1200167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fair enough. Love the preview Btw, who can I thank for Iselei being +700% more awesome?</div> </div> </div> </div>The wonderful Vera Vartanian!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T12:17:45-07:00","id":1200177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kickstarter James</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200121#post1200121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Was there ever a regular version of Exalted 3rd Edition? Or just the PDF and deluxe hardcover? I think this may be following a similar path.</div> </div> </div> </div>There was not.<br /> <br /> There were, if I recall correctly, two ways to get a physical copy of Exalted via KS, the same was with this current one: what DTRPG now calls the &quot;premium&quot; hardback, which had a pledge level of roughly 120 bucks, about what it retails for, and the deluxe hardcover.<br /> <br /> But you can also buy the standard hardback from DTRPG, which isn't quite as fancy but honestly you have trouble telling the difference without putting them side by side, and it's like half the cost. This wasn't a kickstarter pledge level. The equivalent of this almost never is, in my experience. That's fair enough, but it puts me personally in a bind on many kickstarters; I want to pledge, but I also don't want to waste money on stuff I don't want.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I know on the last 3 kickstarters that I ran for them, we didn't have deluxe versions, just regular hardcover levels. Trinity was a bit more complicated, because there were 2 books. </div> </div> </div>I think what I'm calling premium (because that's what DTRPG does) is your &quot;regular.&quot; There's a level below that, what they usually call &quot;standard.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T12:31:12-07:00","id":1200182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSly9</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200159#post1200159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> OPP has flat out stated the standard edition is not what their KS are for. So you can continue to be frustrated by it, but they've already given you the answer already. You continuing to be mad at the process is on you.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Q: </span></span></span><i>Why is a Kickstarter necessary?</i></i> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>A. It isn\u2019t. All our White Wolf licensed Kickstarters thus far, and all similar planned future Kickstarters, <b>are for deluxe editions only</b>...&quot;</i></span></span></span><br /> </div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s not true though. Beast:The Primordial at least was a \u201cprestige,\u201d which is a standard print book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T13:09:55-07:00","id":1200198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200177#post1200177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's fair enough, but it puts me personally in a bind on many kickstarters; I want to pledge, but I also don't want to waste money on stuff I don't want.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's a tough call. I believe the plan is to have the regular options available on DriveThru after the deluxe version is created, so for many, it may be worth holding off until the appropriate version becomes available.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22659-kickstarter-james","name":"Kickstarter James","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22659_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T13:13:54-07:00","id":1200201,"title":"","content":"Just gonna say this, I love descriptions of places in this series. I don't know the specifics of why, but I love the how they describe a place that is only accessible via handholds a DB carved into the mountain with their bare hands. Granted I'm not picturing like scooping them out or anything I'm just picturing the DB just digging their hands and feet into the mountain as he climbed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T13:18:33-07:00","id":1200202,"title":"","content":"Well, just put in my backing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T13:58:58-07:00","id":1200218,"