b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200361#post1200361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder, how many people actually watched the video?</div> </div> </div> </div>It took me about two hours to realize the video existed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T10:32:49-07:00","id":1200477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200361#post1200361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder, how many people actually watched the video?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I did. Lots of cool art that wasn't necessarily used the body of the campaign text. Also, Vance sounds different than I would have imagined. I then discovered I have been pronouncing &quot;gentes&quot; wrong this whole time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T14:04:47-07:00","id":1200568,"title":"","content":"A question, since I've never seen this type of add on PDF thing go all the way through yet, will heirs to the shogunate be available as it's own product? If it gets big enough will it have a physical version?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T14:17:41-07:00","id":1200577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lionmanguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200568#post1200568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question, since I've never seen this type of add on PDF thing go all the way through yet, will heirs to the shogunate be available as it's own product? If it gets big enough will it have a physical version?</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine it will end up as its own supplemental product like Mircales did with the backer charms. Though I seriously doubt that it can become big enough to become POD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T14:33:20-07:00","id":1200580,"title":"","content":"I'm confused. Is there a way to just get a hard copy of What Fire Has Wrought through the Kickstarter? The Realm PDF is a nice idea too, but it looks like none of the tiers offer a basic hardback version.<br /> <br /> Or is there a way to get the PDF through KS and get a discount on DTRPG version for the standard hardback book?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T14:33:39-07:00","id":1200581,"title":"","content":"I would love heirs to the shogunate to be POD. I may just be old but I prefer books to read and play out of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10745-nosleeves","name":"nosleeves","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T14:45:56-07:00","id":1200588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nosleeves</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200581#post1200581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would love heirs to the shogunate to be POD. I may just be old but I prefer books to read and play out of.</div> </div> </div> </div>It'll probably be available as an option, kind of like how Miracles fo the Solar Exalted had one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T15:21:39-07:00","id":1200602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200580#post1200580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm confused. Is there a way to just get a hard copy of What Fire Has Wrought through the Kickstarter? The Realm PDF is a nice idea too, but it looks like none of the tiers offer a basic hardback version.<br /> <br /> Or is there a way to get the PDF through KS and get a discount on DTRPG version for the standard hardback book?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Kickstarter is for funding the Deluxe version of the text. If you just want the basic PoD version, you're better off just waiting for it to come out on DriveThru. <br /> <br /> That said, I think DriveThru has been pretty good about giving discounts on the PoD version to everyone who previously bought the PDF before the PoD is ready. If you want to be sure, you could back at the PDF level and ask Rich Thomas via Kickstarter about it, then cancel if it becomes a problem.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T15:27:22-07:00","id":1200607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200602#post1200602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Kickstarter is for funding the Deluxe version of the text. If you just want the basic PoD version, you're better off just waiting for it to come out on DriveThru. <br /> <br /> That said, I think DriveThru has been pretty good about giving discounts on the PoD version to everyone who previously bought the PDF before the PoD is ready. If you want to be sure, you could back at the PDF level and ask Rich Thomas via Kickstarter about it, then cancel if it becomes a problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then it becomes a question of time. I have a game starting in about 3 weeks. Going on previous history, it feels more like months between the KS version appearing and POD making an appearance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T15:52:28-07:00","id":1200617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xerxes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200607#post1200607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then it becomes a question of time. I have a game starting in about 3 weeks. Going on previous history, it feels more like months between the KS version appearing and POD making an appearance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well $5 gets you the previews of the book, which as previously stated are basically the book sans art and some formatting. That way you have the stuff for running the game until such time as you can order the POD version. That's the best I can recommend in <b> just </b> getting the POD version, but still being able to run your game when the scheduled time comes.*<br /> <br /> *Based on the other one I'm operating on the idea that you have no interest in pdf version, not meaning to sound rude if you had other ideas and just wanted the POD to go with the pdf, but not the deluxe book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T16:16:46-07:00","id":1200625,"title":"","content":"Forest-Witch expansion Chapter is in the companion!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T16:47:17-07:00","id":1200634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200625#post1200625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Forest-Witch expansion Chapter is in the companion!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Still weird to me how big of a deal they are in this one...I'm guessing Parsadi weirdness is already included?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T16:58:08-07:00","id":1200640,"title":"","content":"Since the &quot;at cost&quot; option for PoD is only listed for those options including the limited edition, I guess there's no chance to get that as a &quot;pdf only&quot; backer?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2219-delta","name":"Delta","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T18:08:14-07:00","id":1200655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Delta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200640#post1200640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the &quot;at cost&quot; option for PoD is only listed for those options including the limited edition, I guess there's no chance to get that as a &quot;pdf only&quot; backer?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because traditionally printed books take many months longer to make than PoD books, Onyx Path has been very kind to offer a PoD discount so that we can have physical books in our hands as soon as they become an option, if we want them. <br /> <br /> DrivethruRPG usually offers a package discount if you buy the pdf and PoD together which is different than the PoD discount mentioned on the KS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T18:15:52-07:00","id":1200657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200634#post1200634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Still weird to me how big of a deal they are in this one...I'm guessing Parsadi weirdness is already included?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Prasadi DBs aren't in the companion yet, but it's a very likely stretch goal according to James Bell, the Onyx Path guy in charge of managing the Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/91-wandering","name":"Wandering","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar91_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T18:21:32-07:00","id":1200658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200634#post1200634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still weird to me how big of a deal they are in this one...I'm guessing Parsadi weirdness is already included?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Forest Witches were introduced in the 1e Book, Exalted: The Outcaste, along with Lookshy and a group of Terrestrial Pirates that were getting weird in the Wyld. The Forest Witches were written by Rebecca Borgstrom and they were a gloriously weird and transhuman society, so I think they've garnered a following.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T18:48:22-07:00","id":1200663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200658#post1200658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Forest Witches were introduced in the 1e Book, Exalted: The Outcaste, along with Lookshy and a group of Terrestrial Pirates that were getting weird in the Wyld. The Forest Witches were written by Rebecca Borgstrom and they were a gloriously weird and transhuman society, so I think they've garnered a following.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe it's because I'm a filthy &quot;Got in during 2e&quot; Heathen but i found the Forest Witch write-up to be alright but nothing that made me think &quot;I need to play one of these now&quot;<br /> <br /> Granted I'm eager to sink my teeth into a Lookshy character so maybe I'm not the target audience. I mean I don't dislike them and I won't begrudge them getting some space in WFHW","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T19:00:59-07:00","id":1200667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200658#post1200658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Forest Witches were introduced in the 1e Book, Exalted: The Outcaste, along with Lookshy and a group of Terrestrial Pirates that were getting weird in the Wyld. The Forest Witches were written by Rebecca Borgstrom and they were a gloriously weird and transhuman society, so I think they've garnered a following.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Good to hear! I...never really got them, found them kinda peripheral, and had no clue what to do with this weird cult that had a heavenly after life with no clear downsides, so I was hoping Parsaad would come before them in the companion stretch goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T19:02:36-07:00","id":1200668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200634#post1200634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Still weird to me how big of a deal they are in this one...I'm guessing Parsadi weirdness is already included?</div> </div> </div> </div>We do know they\u2019re in the Realm book. Lookshy and Forest-Witches, etc, aren\u2019t. So while a Prasad stretch goal may be in the cards, it\u2019s a lower priority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-28-2018, 10:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T19:23:22-07:00","id":1200675,"title":"","content":"I just like having new Dragon-Blooded societies in general, but it is nice to finally know what all the fuss about Forest Witches is about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T19:49:08-07:00","id":1200682,"title":"","content":"I never understood the draw of the Forest Witches. Sure maybe they are kinda cool, but their think is kinda limited in scope, and they are pretty isolated and inclined to stay that way. Combined with the &quot;yay happily ever after afterlife&quot; thing they've got going on, the seem to be of little impact on the world and have little to do worthy of a game in their own sphere of influence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T20:01:47-07:00","id":1200687,"title":"","content":"I'd need to go reread the 2e write up, but I think there was stuff lost between 2e and 1e about them. Among other things, the Sea of Mind is very weird, not a perfect afterlife by any means, and they need artifacts and hearthstones to keep enlarging the thing so it can accommodate the new people that die. It's also likely made from a sleeping/dead primordial or some other, weirder thing.<br /> <br /> Among other things, living in it....it's kinda like dreaming or living in a book, where you can just say &quot;and then Setsuko went on an epic quest&quot; and it doesn't take any real time. Also, if your will isn't strong enough then you can tend to become kind of a background character.<br /> <br /> Has anyone here seen the Doctor Who episode Silence in the Library? Because Donna's life in the computer is a pretty accurate depiction of what living in the Sea of Mind is like.<br /> <br /> Edit: sorry it was Forest of the Dead: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idMzmN_A5SM\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idMzmN_A5SM</a><br /> <br /> I forgot for a moment. <br /> <br /> ...But then I remembered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 03-29-2018, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T20:19:43-07:00","id":1200692,"title":"","content":"IIRC, Borgstrom/Moran was specifically exploring cyberpunk tropes in a fantasy context with the Forest Witches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T01:57:18-07:00","id":1200742,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Cathak Elanda and Cynis Cerise happen to align closely with my having very recently gotten back to watching the BBC drama Call the Midwife. Specifically, its fifth season, which had a recurring storyline concerning the mystery of a sharp increase in children being born with severe disorders.</span></span></span></div><br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">It got me thinking about how, historically, children such as that were liable to be euthanized in one manner or another, assuming that they could even survive past the first year of their life.</span></span></span></div><br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">But things are different in the Scarlet Dynasty; not only do they have highly sophisticated and miraculous medicine, they place a rather high value in the lives of their children. There's always been a basic principle that, since you never know which child is going to Exalt, you raise all of them in preparation for the possibility that they might. That's compounded now with the concept of procreative Essence; the notion that the first child you have has the highest likelihood of Exalting, and if they fail to survive, you'll have to wait for years before your chance would be as good again.</span></span></span></div><br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">It gave me the image of a Dragon Blooded who was born lacking arms and legs and with malformed lungs, the kind of condition where even in the 1960s you weren't liable to live more than a few days, to a mother who, between her own character and those aforementioned social values, would be quite adamant that he should live at least long enough to have a chance at being Exalted, and so paid the physicians of the Realm vast sums to keep her child alive.</span></span></span></div><br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Upon their Exaltation, ensuring that even with reduced physical capacity basic survival is assured, the child is presented with the long prepared gift of a prosthetic body constructed from green jade and moonsilver and the wood of a mystically cultivated tree. The Realm may lack the technology of the First Age that would give it the full range of motion of a fully formed body, and even the effort and expense of this one was beyond what many Dynasts would be willing or able to pay for a child with a less severe condition, but it will suffice to afford freedom of movement and independent living for participation in the society of the Exalted. </span></span></span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T04:02:59-07:00","id":1200751,"title":"","content":"I did my kick in between meetings, so missed the video. Some day I'll be able to catch up!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T13:00:00-07:00","id":1200944,"title":"","content":"Thanks to this KS we now know more about the structure that upcoming books will have. Particularly, I think we can expect future exalts to have a similar display of &quot;playable options&quot; as we've seen so far, the &quot;play this if you want to...&quot; section.<br /> <br /> I wonder what we'll see in Lunars, Sidereals, or Abyssals, cause right now I can only think of: chimera and non-chimera, loyal and rogue Deathknight, and Ronin and non-ronin sidereal.<br /> <br /> The future looks interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T13:31:08-07:00","id":1200954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200944#post1200944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks to this KS we now know more about the structure that upcoming books will have. Particularly, I think we can expect future exalts to have a similar display of &quot;playable options&quot; as we've seen so far, the &quot;play this if you want to...&quot; section.<br /> <br /> I wonder what we'll see in Lunars, Sidereals, or Abyssals, cause right now I can only think of: chimera and non-chimera, loyal and rogue Deathknight, and Ronin and non-ronin sidereal.<br /> <br /> The future looks interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh. For Lunars myself I see Silver Pact and non-Silver Pact; chimerism is a Charm choice.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T13:35:35-07:00","id":1200961,"title":"","content":"Well with Lunar I would imagine Silver Pact, not with the pact, and working for certain powerful individuals. <br /> <br /> The Abyssals are supposed to be getting rather extreme shifts from 2nd, so I can't guess outside of the obvious like free agent and having a mentor. <br /> <br /> The Sids will be interesting to see if there are other factions offered or if it plays it more like other divisions. Like monitoring the locations of exigence and trying to retrieve stolen ones, dealing with the Immaculate Order, hunting Rakan Thulio and his Getimian, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T14:05:07-07:00","id":1200976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200663#post1200663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe it's because I'm a filthy &quot;Got in during 2e&quot; Heathen but i found the Forest Witch write-up to be alright but nothing that made me think &quot;I need to play one of these now&quot;<br /> <br /> Granted I'm eager to sink my teeth into a Lookshy character so maybe I'm not the target audience. I mean I don't dislike them and I won't begrudge them getting some space in WFHW</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think it's just you. The 2E write-up on them really didn't do much to make them exciting as a player option, or even really understandable. And I haven't actually read their presentation in 1E, but I can't recall ever hearing of anyone playing one. That said, the description in the 3E book does excite me! I'm definitely interested in seeing more on them and if I ever get the chance I'd love to play one now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/91-wandering","name":"Wandering","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar91_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T14:38:12-07:00","id":1200997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200954#post1200954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh. For Lunars myself I see Silver Pact and non-Silver Pact; chimerism is a Charm choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe even Caul Lunar or who knows what other options!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T15:06:15-07:00","id":1201010,"title":"","content":"And the t-shirt stretch goal is achieved, which I don\u2019t personally care about, but obviously plenty of peoples are into that sort of thing or they wouldn\u2019t keep doing it, so that\u2019s cool. 10k more until Outcaste section gets added to the Companion!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T15:14:44-07:00","id":1201014,"title":"","content":"The Forest Witches are really interesting to me, and I'm happy they'll receive some more treatment. Not only is the Sea of Mind a pretty out-there idea that need some development, I also like that we see a group of Terrestrials that's properly nature-oriented. Despite being elemental Exalts of primal natural forces, the Dragon-Blooded tend towards civilization. It's cool to see a culture that forgoes the &quot;standard&quot; empire and city setting. I also think a more prevalent place for Forest Witches in the setting justifies some Charm effects that might not otherwise be seen, particularly with Wood-based themes.<br /> <br /> I might get the shirt, depending on the design. I'm much more interested in a &quot;Dragon-Blooded&quot; t-shirt than a &quot;What Fire has Wrought KS&quot; t-shirt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T15:31:51-07:00","id":1201022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201014#post1201014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Forest Witches are really interesting to me, and I'm happy they'll receive some more treatment. Not only is the Sea of Mind a pretty out-there idea that need some development, I also like that we see a group of Terrestrials that's properly nature-oriented. Despite being elemental Exalts of primal natural forces, the Dragon-Blooded tend towards civilization. It's cool to see a culture that forgoes the &quot;standard&quot; empire and city setting. I also think a more prevalent place for Forest Witches in the setting justifies some Charm effects that might not otherwise be seen, particularly with Wood-based themes.<br /> <br /> I might get the shirt, depending on the design. I'm much more interested in a &quot;Dragon-Blooded&quot; t-shirt than a &quot;What Fire has Wrought KS&quot; t-shirt.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn\u2019t exactly call them \u201cnature oriented.\u201d They\u2019re living in something akin to a haunted forest with animated trees and possessed animals that see to their every desire as long as they\u2019re properly propitiated. That\u2019s pretty far away from what we think of as nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T16:21:59-07:00","id":1201044,"title":"","content":"Too bad kickstarter doesn't accept paypal, not going to get a credit card for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T17:02:04-07:00","id":1201061,"title":"","content":"two new stretch goals after the Outcastes section.<br /> <br /> A section in the Companion on Cadet Houses at 165k.<br /> <br /> Increasing the art budget at 174k.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T17:34:17-07:00","id":1201078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201044#post1201044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Too bad kickstarter doesn't accept paypal, not going to get a credit card for this.</div> </div> </div> </div>They take debit","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T17:53:09-07:00","id":1201086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wandering</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200976#post1200976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think it's just you. The 2E write-up on them really didn't do much to make them exciting as a player option, or even really understandable. And I haven't actually read their presentation in 1E, but I can't recall ever hearing of anyone playing one. That said, the description in the 3E book does excite me! I'm definitely interested in seeing more on them and if I ever get the chance I'd love to play one now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait the Forest Witches were in 2nd? I honestly don't remember them cropping up until I got the Outcast book from 1st ed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T18:02:33-07:00","id":1201096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201086#post1201086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait the Forest Witches were in 2nd? I honestly don't remember them cropping up until I got the Outcast book from 1st ed.</div> </div> </div> </div>They were in the East book or the DB book, I forget which.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T18:23:15-07:00","id":1201104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201096#post1201096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They were in the East book or the DB book, I forget which.</div> </div> </div> </div>They were in teh DB book, but was kind fo written in a way that as I gather, wasn't sure what to do with them and tried to give as good a summary as it could despite, in a strange take with 2e stuff, not try to pin down what the hell was going on in that forest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T18:33:24-07:00","id":1201106,"title":"","content":"The 2e DB book had a section on the Forest Witches, Scroll of Exalts had char writeups for two of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201078#post1201078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They take debit</div> </div> </div> </div>edit: nevermind. Doesn't work due to system differences between europe and the US. I get that Amazon doesn't want the competition via Paypal, but they really ought to think of an alternative to credit cards because relativly few people use them here. They have alternatives for their localized store, just international stuff seems to be impossible for some reason without a credit card.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 03-29-2018, 09:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T23:13:02-07:00","id":1201152,"title":"","content":"What is the difference between a &quot;Dynastic Outcaste&quot; and a &quot;Foreign Outcaste&quot; in the terrestrial census blurb? Are the Dynastic ones just regular Outcastes whose parent was specifically from the Realm? Is that a distinction the Realm even makes, the difference between some Outcaste DB whose parent they think was one of theirs and some Outcaste DB who just popped up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T23:31:50-07:00","id":1201159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201152#post1201152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the difference between a &amp;quot;Dynastic Outcaste&amp;quot; and a &amp;quot;Foreign Outcaste&amp;quot; in the terrestrial census blurb? Are the Dynastic ones just regular Outcastes whose parent was specifically from the Realm? Is that a distinction the Realm even makes, the difference between some Outcaste DB whose parent they think was one of theirs and some Outcaste DB who just popped up?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe \u201cDynastic Outcastes\u201d refers to Found-Eggs in the territories of the Realm. Those who are offered the Razor or the Coin. Foreign Outcastes is pretty much just \u201ceveryone else\u201d beyond the Realm (including Prasad) and Lookshy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T23:35:29-07:00","id":1201162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1200182#post1200182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s not true though. Beast:The Primordial at least was a \u201cprestige,\u201d which is a standard print book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So that one time somehow proves that their intent is not to do what they've stated to do? Sorry, but that doesn't hold any actual weight. If, for example, they had done 15 KS with just standard print books I'd take that point more seriously. They haven't, though. You can ignore what OPP has stated, but I really don't see would you would put your head in the sand. Acting out when they've told you they aren't going to do something seems asinine to me, but again, you can do whatever you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11633-thesly9","name":"TheSly9","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11633_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T04:47:23-07:00","id":1201209,"title":"","content":"Okay, so I'm a couple of paragraphs into reading the entry for House Ragara, and I remembered a little something that I thought of when I woke up in the morning: a final word on the subject of Ragara Bhagwei.<br /> <br /> Sure, with the way that Cynis the person and the House is set up now, Bhagwei's Aspect and his inclinations seem as though they could be something that comes from his mother, but in that early haze I was struck with the notion that, between the manner in which Ragara has always been portrayed and what this Edition has been setting up, him being the one who got Bhagwei could be as simple as &quot;this is my first-born child, and I <i>want</i> him&quot;, and employing some... singular methods to get a bunch of the other relevant figures to comply.<br /> <br /> That's what I thought before starting to read the write-up, and the initial words seem to validate that kind of perspective.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T05:45:12-07:00","id":1201214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201106#post1201106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The 2e DB book had a section on the Forest Witches, Scroll of Exalts had char writeups for two of them.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> edit: nevermind. Doesn't work due to system differences between europe and the US. I get that Amazon doesn't want the competition via Paypal, but they really ought to think of an alternative to credit cards because relativly few people use them here. They have alternatives for their localized store, just international stuff seems to be impossible for some reason without a credit card.</div> </div> </div> </div>I paid with my debit card. Maybe it's an issue with your bank?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T06:26:44-07:00","id":1201228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201214#post1201214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I paid with my debit card. Maybe it's an issue with your bank?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's an issue with the debit card type. The one I have doesn't work for the US due to different systems being involved as I understand it. (Chipbased technology which isn't really widespread outside of Europe. V pay to be precise.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T08:13:18-07:00","id":1201270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSly9</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201162#post1201162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> So that one time somehow proves that their intent is not to do what they've stated to do? Sorry, but that doesn't hold any actual weight. If, for example, they had done 15 KS with just standard print books I'd take that point more seriously. They haven't, though. You can ignore what OPP has stated, but I really don't see would you would put your head in the sand. Acting out when they've told you they aren't going to do something seems asinine to me, but again, you can do whatever you want.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cAll of our white wolf licensed... have been deluxe...\u201d is a factually untrue statement. I don\u2019t know what the hell you\u2019re on about me \u201cacting out.\u201d I have pointed out a discrepancy between statement and fact. If I have to go digging through kickstarters to find more prestiges to prove my point, I guess I\u2019ll do that later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T10:51:42-07:00","id":1201324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201270#post1201270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u201cAll of our white wolf licensed... have been deluxe...\u201d is a factually untrue statement. I don\u2019t know what the hell you\u2019re on about me \u201cacting out.\u201d I have pointed out a discrepancy between statement and fact. If I have to go digging through kickstarters to find more prestiges to prove my point, I guess I\u2019ll do that later.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know when the quoted comment was made, but at a point during our KSs that was true. And if you consider anything besides a standard press run book as &quot;Deluxe&quot;, then that's still true, I guess. But in my mind I've tried to keep separate our Deluxe project KSs (which are called Deluxe on their KSs), our Prestige edition KSs (which our Chronicles of Darkness books have been), and projects we Kickstarted to get a traditional regular print run created and out into stores (something we've started doing and are doing more of). If somebody mis-spoke, they made a mistake in nomenclature and let's just all get on the same page regardless of the cited comment and step back a bit from fighting over it.<br /> <br /> BTW, our Prestige Editions have not been just regular printed books as we've added bells and whistles to be at least on par with the most ornate CofD core books WW was capable of doing back in the day, and often enhanced them more. Those core books back then were not business as usual in printing either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T11:23:20-07:00","id":1201332,"title":"","content":"As we near the Cadet Houses milestone (Yay), I can't help but wonder what may come next. I would personally hope for more heirlooms since it increases the chance for a DB warstrider (they never really show up beyond artifact books traditionally but you never know) but more realistically I think that we might get a milestone for elaborating on the Secondary Schools.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T11:49:43-07:00","id":1201344,"title":"","content":"Man, wish I had the money for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T13:00:06-07:00","id":1201368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gigaton-Falcon-Emu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201332#post1201332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we near the Cadet Houses milestone (Yay), I can't help but wonder what may come next. I would personally hope for more heirlooms since it increases the chance for a DB warstrider (they never really show up beyond artifact books traditionally but you never know) but more realistically I think that we might get a milestone for elaborating on the Secondary Schools.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I guess there is already two Dragonblood warstriders; the Green Jade centaur and the Black Jade one with the trident from Arms.<br /> <br /> Saying this, I certainly wouldn't mind a White, Blue or Red Jade warstrider in the Dragonblood stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T13:34:51-07:00","id":1201388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201368#post1201368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I guess there is already two Dragonblood warstriders; the Green Jade centaur and the Black Jade one with the trident from Arms.<br /> <br /> Saying this, I certainly wouldn't mind a White, Blue or Red Jade warstrider in the Dragonblood stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Meant warstriders in general with DBs setting a precedent. But a white jade one would be pretty <i>solid</i>.<br /> <br /> A man can hope! Btw, we have Cadet houses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T14:21:08-07:00","id":1201409,"title":"","content":"So looks like we just got the cadet house expansion. This will be fun. Does that mean we'll be getting figures and examples of those as well? Cause I can always use more characters I don't have to build in a campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T17:36:39-07:00","id":1201482,"title":"","content":"My only real guess for upcoming stretch goals is that they're trying to make them line up with the preview of that week. So next week might have some for the schools or other aspects of dynast life, as well as various things for outcastes, and so on and so on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T19:26:51-07:00","id":1201508,"title":"","content":"Any other heirloom backers here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T19:43:33-07:00","id":1201513,"title":"","content":"They just added the Archimandrite of the Immaculate Order level, which includes a Deluxe Hardcover of the original Core book! So, if you missed the original KS, now's your chance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T19:45:45-07:00","id":1201516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201508#post1201508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any other heirloom backers here?</div> </div> </div> </div>I considered it, but I like creating my own artifacts. I maybe should have gone for it, dunno. I suppose I just like being more hands on when making an artifact than I expect to be with this reward.<br /> <br /> What artifact are you considering, if you don't mind discussing it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{