omething, just having not gained something that never existed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T16:38:01-07:00","id":1207445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207443#post1207443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm, er, I'm pretty happy with what we've got now. If nobody commissions any extra Charms, I don't see that as having lost something, just having not gained something that never existed.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Less Vance-written Charms than could be had = bad<br /> <br /> Especially since their xp progression means that Dragon-Blooded need a lot of things to invest in in their concept-areas before being forced to invest outside their concept just to spend the xp.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T16:43:52-07:00","id":1207448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207445#post1207445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Less Vance-written Charms than could be had = bad</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI feel as though this is an attitude that might lead to somebody spending an inordinate amount of money on a Kickstarter, and I think they should be advised against that.<br /> <br /> \u200bI would also take issue if I thought that somebody was going around just short of demanding that people get themselves or their associates to spend money because of how it would benefit the solicitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T16:57:50-07:00","id":1207452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207448#post1207448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bI feel as though this is an attitude that might lead to somebody spending an inordinate amount of money on a Kickstarter, and I think they should be advised against that.<br /> <br /> \u200bI would also take issue if I thought that somebody was going around just short of demanding that people get themselves or their associates to spend money because of how it would benefit the solicitor.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that\u2019s a willfully uncharitable reading of what i said, but if it needs to be clarified then fine:<br /> <br /> People who haven\u2019t been following the Kickstarter as closely as we have are likely unaware than there are additional custom charms available. If you know Exalted fans who would be interested but maybe thought they all sold out, point it out. Don\u2019t push the Kickstarter on people not interested, or who don\u2019t have the money to spend. Crowdfunding works through viral support informing people, as this forum, rpg.net, and the reddit page represent only a tiny sliver of the actual fan base.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:00:07-07:00","id":1207497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207397#post1207397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The former.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I might ask for some clarification. The Kickstarter had a part where the charms would be expanded in the first week. Does that mean that there will be dev developed charms in addition to backer charms OR was it to open up the possibility for backer based charms? Also will there be a return of the Apocryphal Keyword?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:02:17-07:00","id":1207499,"title":"","content":"Hey, not to sound like a fool but I have never messed with kickstarter add ons before. If I want for instance the screen how do I add that to my order?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:04:18-07:00","id":1207501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207497#post1207497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I might ask for some clarification. The Kickstarter had a part where the charms would be expanded in the first week. Does that mean that there will be dev developed charms in addition to backer charms OR was it to open up the possibility for backer based charms? Also will there be a return of the Apocryphal Keyword?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The stretch goal was for a set of charms in ADDITION to the backer commissioned charms (note that Miracles of the Solar Exalted has both custom charms and ones Morke wanted to add himself in it). The backer commissioned charms were already a reward tier before that stretchgoal was reached.<br /> <br /> Whether the apocryphal keyword is needed will likely depend on whether any of the charm commissioners specifically want something that needs to be apocryphal. I know I'd say &quot;if that needs to be apocryphal, then Iets do this other idea instead&quot; for mine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-15-2018, 11:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:05:20-07:00","id":1207502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207499#post1207499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, not to sound like a fool but I have never messed with kickstarter add ons before. If I want for instance the screen how do I add that to my order?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Just add the cost to your pledge. You'll select what you want when the Backerkit survey goes out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:09:59-07:00","id":1207505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207501#post1207501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The stretch goal was for a set of charms in ADDITION to the backer commissioned charms. The backer commissioned charms were already a reward tier before that stretchgoal was reached.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you for clearing that up for me!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207501#post1207501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Whether the apocryphal charm will be needed will likely depend on whether any of the charm commissioners specifically want something that needs to be apocryphal. I know I'd say &quot;if that needs to be apocryphal, then Iets do this other idea instead&quot; for mine.</div> </div> </div> </div> I hope that this is the general attitude of most backers. While I can appreciate backers getting exactly what they want for the money they spend I personally dislike the whole concept of the apocryphal key word.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T20:38:51-07:00","id":1207520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207505#post1207505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope that this is the general attitude of most backers. While I can appreciate backers getting exactly what they want for the money they spend I personally dislike the whole concept of the apocryphal key word.</div> </div> </div> </div>A personal goal for me is to work with each backer to deliver on the Charm concept they want without having to tag stuff Apocryphal if at all possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T00:49:05-07:00","id":1207572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tribute of a Dark Heart</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1201927#post1201927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am a heirloom backer. I almost missed the reward tier in the rush to get pledged! No plans for a warstrider. I want to see the heirloom artifact chapter to see more about what is possible, but I am thinking about going with an artifact instrument. In the first kickstarter i pledged for the 'choose your martial arts' and i would have picked Silver-voiced Nightingale if one of the others hadn't already announced they were planning to!</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you decided what instrument you want? Because I was playing with backup ideas, and I just thought about using this as an excuse to introduce the sheng to Creation.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheng_(instrument\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheng_(instrument</a>)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bzp_izOv0rA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bzp_izOv0rA\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bzp_izOv0rA </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bzp_izOv0rA\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bzp_izOv0rA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=uRM4iLaV_c8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=uRM4iLaV_c8\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=uRM4iLaV_c8 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=uRM4iLaV_c8\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=uRM4iLaV_c8 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=nn45L7Sebjw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=nn45L7Sebjw\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?app=desktop&amp;v=nn45L7Sebjw </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=nn45L7Sebjw\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=nn45L7Sebjw </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T07:01:43-07:00","id":1207636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207347#post1207347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd think of it more as a guide for Storytellers who want to create and play out their own civil war scenarios, rather than a single linear timeline of how the civil war does/could occur.</div> </div> </div> </div>So it'd be more along the lines of.... I forget which 2E Book it was, but there was a sidebar with like, six different options that the Emissary of Nexus could be, from &quot;the Council of Entities has twelve people running around in identical masks&quot; to &quot;He's a First Age Solar that survived somehow&quot;. Or the one that provided offhand explanations for the Bull of the North that included being a Lunar, Abyssal, etc. instead of a Solar?<br /> <br /> Because those were always some of my favorite things back in the day. You don't need to say how it is, but giving me a half dozen &quot;how it could be&quot; things about something ambiguous is great for letting me see if one of those works for me or I make my own. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1817-opmegs","name":"OpMegs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1817_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T07:21:59-07:00","id":1207643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>OpMegs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207636#post1207636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it'd be more along the lines of.... I forget which 2E Book it was, but there was a sidebar with like, six different options that the Emissary of Nexus could be, from &amp;quot;the Council of Entities has twelve people running around in identical masks&amp;quot; to &amp;quot;He's a First Age Solar that survived somehow&amp;quot;. Or the one that provided offhand explanations for the Bull of the North that included being a Lunar, Abyssal, etc. instead of a Solar?<br /> <br /> Because those were always some of my favorite things back in the day. You don't need to say how it is, but giving me a half dozen &amp;quot;how it could be&amp;quot; things about something ambiguous is great for letting me see if one of those works for me or I make my own. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s the plan, though it would be a much more extensive tool kit, with notes on additional sub-variations. (If it helps, I\u2019m the one who wrote that sidebar on the Bull.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T10:42:59-07:00","id":1207700,"title":"","content":"outcastes Expansion #3 achieved<br /> <br /> At 270k QC write-ups for the 5 new sig Dragon-Blooded are added.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T11:15:24-07:00","id":1207716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207643#post1207643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s the plan, though it would be a much more extensive tool kit, with notes on additional sub-variations. (If it helps, I\u2019m the one who wrote that sidebar on the Bull.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit, I\u2019m pretty excited for the Realm expansions in Heirs. The House writeups gave me a thousand ideas for the civil war, but I feel like I would struggle to pare it down into something reasonable for a table rather than a novel. Some structure is going to be so much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10995-abakus","name":"Abakus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T15:38:59-07:00","id":1207781,"title":"","content":"The new image that appears below the new stretch goal of QC writeups for the new DB circle.. I presume that's supposed to be Yushoto Mathar? If so, it struck me that the story wrote his robin as Red in color with the picture being blue...<br /> <br /> It's a stupid thing to nitpick about, but it was the first thing that caught my attention as it jarred with the opening story which gave me a mental image of them all. Probably easier to change the word in the story than to change the color in the image, but just kind of jarring to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T16:15:33-07:00","id":1207792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207700#post1207700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">outcastes Expansion #3 achieved<br /> <br /> At 270k QC write-ups for the 5 new sig Dragon-Blooded are added.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am shocked the signature characters weren't already getting a write up","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T16:32:44-07:00","id":1207797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207792#post1207792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am shocked the signature characters weren't already getting a write up</div> </div> </div> </div>They were always something we wanted to do, but just couldn\u2019t prioritize over all the other things that need to be given space in the DB hardcover. Hence, stretch goal for the Companion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T16:41:07-07:00","id":1207799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1197474-dragon-blooded-kickstarter-starts-on-the-27th?p=1207781#post1207781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The new image that appears below the new stretch goal of QC writeups for the new DB circle.. I presume that's supposed to be Yushoto Mathar? If so, it struck me that the story wrote his robin as Red in color with the picture being blue...</div> </div> </div> </div>Each story starts with the year it took place in. The intro fiction with the robin was fifty years ago, and alas, robins only live a fraction of that. Mathar's been through his share of birds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":